# Windows checkouts get CRLF locally; everything committed and everything CI
# checks out stays LF. Workflow files with shell heredocs break on CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The one exception. cmd.exe misreads labels and GOTOs in LF-only batch files,
# so the Windows build script keeps Windows line endings even in the repo.
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
